      "releaseNotes": "• Switch on Motion in Duo Engine Room to keep the gears turning while the hinge is still. FoldTick remembers your preference.\n• Close your Duo from Engine Room and it returns when you reopen the inner display. If you were on another tab, FoldTick returns you there.\n• Refined the Engine Room layout and display transition when unfolding.",
